{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>יעשן אף.</b> The fire of wrath will burn it until smoke is seen. Now if it is an individual, he dies immediately. And if it is a family, and it lies upon it, all the curses — the meaning is that the curse will lie upon the family until it obliterates [n] its name. And if it is a tribe — and HaShem set it apart for evil. And like it: 'and it shall be HaShem's, and I will offer it up as a burnt offering,' as I have explained it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:25:25.949593905Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}